# Directories holding importable modules, not DAG files.
#
# Airflow's safe-mode DAG discovery imports any .py file containing the string
# "dag" or "airflow", and both packages below mention "DAG" in docstrings. That
# makes Airflow import them standalone as DAG candidates, so any import error
# inside them surfaces in the UI as a spurious DAG import error even though
# neither defines a DAG.
#
# This only affects DAG *discovery* -- the modules stay importable from
# raw_event_to_bronze_orchestrator.py as normal.
config/
processors/
